  "description": "Can you just disappear? In this thrilling program, six duos take on the challenge of staying out of the hands of the hunters for three weeks.\n\nIt is up to the hunters to catch these fugitives, who are doing their utmost to remain undetectable. Along the way, the duos receive clues that lead them to an extraction point. That is the only way to escape the hunters. What is the best tactic for this mission? After all, if you can't trust anyone, where else can you go?",
